EIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">kit</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\"><sup>+</sup></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">&nbsp;산학연포럼은</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\"> 금오공과대학교 총장(우형식)이</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">지역사회와 함께하는<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; 대학으로의 사명과 역할을 수행하고자 2009년 10월 발족하였음&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt dotted; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt dotted; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt dotted; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt dotted\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"559\" height=\"109\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;□ 주요역할</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">구미지역의 산업계, 학계, 연구소, 지방자치단체 간의 활발한 토론 문화를</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> 유도하고,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\"> 기업지원 체제를 구축하는데 대학이 구심점 역할 수행</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">kit</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><sup>+ </sup></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">산학연포럼은 대학이 중심이 되어 새로운 산학연 협력모델 구축</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 22.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;나눔고딕 Bold&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">(산학연공동연구,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\"> 인턴십, 애로기술지원, 새로운 기술개발 창출을 위한 의견교류)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: 필기,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\"> </span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">▣ 일정<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 일시 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #990000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">2011. 11. 23(수) 07:30~09:30(조찬회)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0099; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\"><br>&nbsp; </s